249→  <dt>Assembler</dt>      <dd>ASL Macro Assembler (<code>cpu 96c141</code>)</dd>
250→  <dt>VM origin</dt>      <dd>Big-endian Amiga/68k bytecode on little-endian TLCS-900</dd>
